---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import '../../styles/sports-v2.css';
---

<Layout
  title="Football data & sports products | M221Tech"
  description="Explore M221Tech Sports: M221Foot, football competition data, match context and the WC2026 tournament experience."
>
  <div class="m221-sports-page">
    <section class="m221-sports-hero">
      <div class="m221-container m221-sports-hero-grid">
        <div>
          <a class="m221-sports-breadcrumb" href="/#projects">← M221Tech / Projects</a>
          <span class="m221-sports-kicker">M221TECH / SPORTS</span>
          <h1>Football data, shaped around the game.</h1>
          <p class="m221-sports-lead">Competitions, clubs, matches and richer layers of context — structured into products made to explore, follow and use.</p>
          <div class="m221-sports-actions">
            <a class="is-primary" href="https://sports.m221.tech" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Open M221Foot ↗</a>
            <a class="is-secondary" href="#platform">Explore Sports ↓</a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="m221-sports-field" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="m221-sports-center-circle"></div>
          <span class="m221-sports-zone" data-zone="competition">Competition</span>
          <span class="m221-sports-zone" data-zone="club">Club</span>
          <span class="m221-sports-zone" data-zone="match">Match</span>
          <span class="m221-sports-zone" data-zone="intelligence">Intelligence</span>
          <span class="m221-sports-field-label">SPORTS / DATA FIELD</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <div class="m221-sports-strip" aria-label="Sports data layers">
      <div class="m221-container m221-sports-strip-inner">
        <div class="m221-sports-strip-item"><span>01</span>Competitions</div>
        <div class="m221-sports-strip-item"><span>02</span>Clubs</div>
        <div class="m221-sports-strip-item"><span>03</span>Matches</div>
        <div class="m221-sports-strip-item"><span>04</span>Intelligence</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <section class="m221-sports-chapter" id="platform">
      <div class="m221-container">
        <header class="m221-sports-chapter-head">
          <div class="m221-sports-index">01 / PLATFORM</div>
          <h2>One platform for the long run.</h2>
          <p>M221Foot is the core Sports product: the place where competition structure and match detail come together.</p>
        </header>

        <article class="m221-sports-core">
          <div class="m221-sports-core-copy">
            <span class="m221-sports-eyebrow">CORE PRODUCT / M221FOOT</span>
            <h3>M221Foot</h3>
            <p>A football platform built around competitions, clubs, fixtures, results, match events and richer views when the data allows it.</p>
            <div class="m221-sports-core-actions">
              <a class="m221-sports-open" href="https://sports.m221.tech" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Enter M221Foot ↗</a>
              <a class="m221-sports-domain" href="https://sports.m221.tech" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">sports.m221.tech</a>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="m221-sports-layers" aria-label="M221Foot data layers">
            <div class="m221-sports-layer"><strong>Competition</strong><span>Structure</span></div>
            <div class="m221-sports-layer"><strong>Club</strong><span>Context</span></div>
            <div class="m221-sports-layer"><strong>Match</strong><span>Detail</span></div>
            <div class="m221-sports-layer"><strong>Intelligence</strong><span>Explore</span></div>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="m221-sports-chapter m221-sports-tournament" id="tournament">
      <div class="m221-container">
        <header class="m221-sports-chapter-head">
          <div class="m221-sports-index">02 / TOURNAMENT</div>
          <h2>A tournament layer, not a second universe.</h2>
          <p>WC2026 takes the same Sports logic and focuses it on one event: faster, seasonal and deliberately lighter than the core platform.</p>
        </header>

        <div class="m221-sports-tournament-grid">
          <div class="m221-sports-tournament-mark" aria-hidden="true">
            <span>SPORTS / EVENT MODE</span>
            <strong>Same field.<br />Different rhythm.</strong>
          </div>

          <article class="m221-sports-event">
            <div class="m221-sports-event-top">
              <span>EVENT EXPERIENCE</span>
              <span>2026</span>
            </div>
            <h3>WC2026</h3>
            <p>A focused World Cup experience built as an extension of the Sports universe rather than a separate product family.</p>
            <div class="m221-sports-event-actions">
              <a class="is-open" href="https://wc2026.m221.tech" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Open WC2026 ↗</a>
              <a class="is-domain" href="https://wc2026.m221.tech" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">wc2026.m221.tech</a>
            </div>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="m221-sports-chapter" id="data">
      <div class="m221-container">
        <header class="m221-sports-chapter-head">
          <div class="m221-sports-index">03 / DATA</div>
          <h2>From raw match sheets to something navigable.</h2>
          <p>The product starts with structure. Detail comes next, then the views that make the data easier to read and compare.</p>
        </header>

        <div class="m221-sports-data-grid">
          <article class="m221-sports-data-item">
            <span>01 / STRUCTURE</span>
            <h3>Competitions first.</h3>
            <p>Seasons, clubs, fixtures, results and tables create the frame everything else sits inside.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="m221-sports-data-item">
            <span>02 / DETAIL</span>
            <h3>Match context matters.</h3>
            <p>Lineups, events, scorers, cards and substitutions add depth when the source data is available.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="m221-sports-data-item">
            <span>03 / INTELLIGENCE</span>
            <h3>Then make it readable.</h3>
            <p>Structured data becomes richer views, comparisons and signals without losing the match underneath.</p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="m221-sports-contact">
      <div class="m221-container m221-sports-contact-inner">
        <div class="m221-sports-index">04 / CONTACT</div>
        <div>
          <h2>Sports data, question or idea?</h2>
          <p>Tell us what you are looking at.</p>
        </div>
        <a href="mailto:m221tech@gmail.com?subject=M221Tech%20Sports">m221tech@gmail.com →</a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</Layout>
